<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Packers And Movers In Transit
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the instant shifting estimate differ for local moves versus long‑distance Transit routes?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The instant estimate for local moves focuses on hourly labor rates, vehicle proximity, and minimal paperwork, while the Transit‑to‑Hub estimate adds distance‑based mileage, highway tolls, and regulatory fees. Both calculations use the same Packers And Movers In Transit pricing engine, ensuring consistency and transparency across service types.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documentation is required to claim the 100% insurance coverage during a Transit relocation?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Clients must provide a signed inventory list, original purchase receipts for high‑value items, a valid e‑Way bill, and the mover’s insurance policy number. Once the goods are delivered, a delivery receipt and photographic proof of condition are needed to trigger the claim process under Packers And Movers In Transit’s policy.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my shipment in real time while it travels the 850 km highway corridor?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. All Packers And Movers In Transit trucks are equipped with GPS devices linked to a live‑tracking portal. Customers receive a secure link to monitor location, estimated arrival, and any checkpoint delays, ensuring full visibility throughout the journey.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there any hidden charges when moving from Transit to a major hub like Delhi or Kolkata?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">No hidden fees are applied. The cost matrix disclosed upfront includes mileage, fuel surcharge, tolls, insurance, and any optional services such as extra packing or warehousing. Any additional request, like expedited delivery, is quoted before work begins, keeping the pricing transparent for Packers And Movers In Transit clients.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the 7‑layer packaging protect fragile items compared to standard bubble wrap?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The 7‑layer system combines high‑density bubble cushioning, multi‑ply corrugated sheets, reinforced wooden crates, and weather‑proof stretch film. Each layer addresses a specific risk—impact, compression, moisture, and vibration—providing far greater protection than single‑layer bubble wrap, which is why Packers And Movers In Transit recommend it for delicate goods.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What are the common red flags at highway checkposts that could delay my move?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Typical red flags include missing or inaccurate e‑Way bills, unregistered vehicle documents, and incomplete insurance certificates. Packers And Movers In Transit pre‑verify all paperwork and provide a checklist to avoid such delays, ensuring smooth passage through every checkpoint.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is the IBA approval mandatory for hiring Packers And Movers In Transit for corporate relocations?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">While not legally mandatory, IBA approval signals adherence to industry best practices, standardized pricing, and consumer protection norms. Corporate clients often prefer IBA‑approved movers like Packers And Movers In Transit to ensure reliable service, auditability, and compliance with internal relocation policies.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
